      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the draft, it's a good start and definitely feels human. i appreciate you not just dumping a list in there.\n\nbut i just ran it through the internal tool and the score came back super low (only like 2 points). the marketing team is going to think we aren't even mentioning our core value proposition if the score isn't at least decent. \n\ncould you try a version that's a bit more substantial? maybe weave in a few more of those features from the list so they actually see the depth of the platform? just keep it natural, i don't want it to look like a list, but we really need that score to be higher so it actually qualifies as a \"high-value\" email in our system.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a revised version of the email that incorporates more features in a natural and human-friendly way:\n\nSubject: Reconnecting and Unlocking New Insights\n\nDear [User Name],\n\nI hope you're doing well. We've been thinking about you and wanted to check in on FlowState CRM. As a valued user, we're committed to helping you achieve your goals, and we think our features can help you stay on track.\n\nOne area where we're seeing a lot of value is in helping teams collaborate more effectively. Our team collaboration chat and real-time activity feeds can help you and your team stay connected and up-to-date on the latest developments. And with automated lead scoring, you can quickly identify high-potential opportunities and focus on the initiatives that matter most.\n\nWe've also made it easier for you to create personalized workflows and track the progress of your clients and prospects. Our API access and bulk import/export capabilities allow you to automate and streamline many tasks, freeing up more time for you to focus on growth and success.\n\nWe've heard that a lot of our users are using our platform to improve their sales pipelines, streamline communication, and gain better insights into their customer behavior. And with our mobile app sync and integrations marketplace, you can ensure",
